# Whitelist: only build inputs enter the build context. Weights, datasets, outputs, virtual
# environments, git history and local configuration can never reach an image layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/
!docker/requirements-model.txt
!docker/requirements-cpu.txt
!docker/patches/
!docker/build_cpu_stack.sh
!configs/
!tests/
!tools/check_restricted.py
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pth
**/*.pt
**/*.pkl
**/*.npz
